        "content": "Thread.stop() throws UnsupportedOperationException since Java 20. Finalization and the Security Manager are deprecated for removal. Java 21 adds sequenced collections (getFirst, getLast, reversed on List, Deque and others); a custom collection class that already declares a method with one of these names but a different return type fails to compile.",
